## Reference: Localized SIP Domain URIs

**Choosing the right region is critical for call quality and latency.** Select the Twilio region closest to where your LiveKit server is hosted:

- **Server in Australia** → Use `sydney`
- **Server in US East (Virginia)** → Use `ashburn`
- **Server in US West (Oregon)** → Use `umatilla`
- **Server in Europe (Ireland)** → Use `dublin`
- **Server in Europe (Germany)** → Use `frankfurt`
- **Server in Asia (Japan)** → Use `tokyo`
- **Server in Asia (Singapore)** → Use `singapore`
- **Server in South America** → Use `sao-paulo`

Replace `your-company-livekit` with your actual Termination SIP URI from Step 3:

| Region | Localized SIP URI |
|--------|-------------------|
| **Asia Pacific Sydney** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.sydney.twilio.com` |
| **North America Virginia** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.ashburn.twilio.com` |
| **North America Oregon** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.umatilla.twilio.com` |
| **Europe Dublin** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.dublin.twilio.com` |
| **Europe Frankfurt** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.frankfurt.twilio.com` |
| **Asia Pacific Tokyo** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.tokyo.twilio.com` |
| **Asia Pacific Singapore** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.singapore.twilio.com` |
| **South America Sao Paulo** | `your-company-livekit.pstn.sao-paulo.twilio.com` |

> **Warning:** Do not omit the region from the address. Using `your-company-livekit.pstn.twilio.com` (without a region) will fail with a DNS resolution error.

