## Quick Reference: Configuration Summary

**Twilio Side:**
```
Elastic SIP Trunk: LiveKit Trunk

General Settings:
  → Symmetric RTP: Enabled
  → Call Recording: Disabled
  → Secure Trunking: Disabled
  → Call Transfer: Disabled

Termination (Outbound):
  → SIP URI: your-company-livekit.pstn.twilio.com
  → IP ACL: Your LiveKit Server IP

Origination (Inbound):
  → SIP URI: sip:your-livekit-server.com
  → Priority: 10, Weight: 10

Numbers:
  → Your purchased Twilio number assigned to trunk
```

**LiveKit Side:**
```
Inbound Trunk:
  → Name: Twilio Inbound
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Numbers: Your Twilio number (without +)
  → Allowed Addresses: Twilio signaling IPs

Dispatch Rule:
  → Linked to: Twilio Inbound trunk
  → Type: Direct/Individual/Multi-Line (your choice)
  → Agent: Your AI agent

Outbound Trunk:
  → Name: Twilio Outbound
  → Address: your-company-livekit.pstn.sydney.twilio.com
  → Transport: UDP
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Numbers: Your Twilio number (without +)
```

